---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="广岛县福山市 福山城天守｜锦乃｜WORKS"
  description=""
>


<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/fukuyamacastle-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/fukuyama2.jpg"
      alt="福山城天守"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->
        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          FUKUYAMA CASTLE MAIN TOWER
        </p>

        <!-- Title -->
        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          福山城天守
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          屹立于备后的江户时代最后一座大型城郭。
        </p>

        <!-- Gold Divider -->
        <div class="mt-1">
          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Summary -->
        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <!-- Scroll -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->
  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">


    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概要
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        建于广岛县福山市的近世城郭福山城，<br>
        是德川幕府为巩固西国统治而修建的近世城郭，<br>
        并在整个江户时代与城下町一同繁荣发展。<br>
        元和8年（1622年），福山藩初代藩主水野胜成主持修建福山城，并于同年建成。<br>
        城中设有以铁板覆盖北面的天守，在日本全国也是极为罕见的结构，福山城也因此成为西日本具有代表性的近世城郭之一。
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl"></div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          关于福山城与天守
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          福山城天守是福山城的象征。水野胜成于元和5年（1619年）入封备后10万石领地后开始主持筑城，并于元和8年（1622年）建成福山城。福山城本身是德川江户幕府为统治与防卫西国而整备的重要近世城郭，也被认为是江户时代后期修建、完成度极高的城郭。

          <br><br>

          天守为五重六层、地下一层的复合式层塔型天守，
          最大的特点是北侧全面覆盖铁板，这在日本全国也是极为罕见的结构。
          此外，天守附近的伏见橹，是奉德川秀忠之命，将京都伏见城的“松之丸东橹”迁建而来的现存遗构，
          其白墙三层的优美姿态，也将桃山时代的建筑风格传承至今。

          <br><br>

          福山藩先后由水野家五代、松平家一代、阿部家十代统治，
          直到明治维新，福山城一直作为城下町藩政的中心发挥着作用。
          然而，明治6年（1873年）的废城令使御殿、仓库等大量建筑遭到拆除。
          此外，在昭和20年（1945年）的福山大空袭中，
          就连曾被指定为国宝的天守和御汤殿也不幸被烧毁。

          <br><br>

          此后，昭和41年（1966年），作为福山市市制50周年纪念事业，天守、御汤殿和月见橹得到复原，
          2022年又为纪念筑城400周年进行了大规模修缮，
          福山城最具象征性的北侧铁板外观也随之得到复原。

          <br><br>

          本作品以2022年修缮后的天守为制作对象，
          将如今仍可看到的最新姿态，以我的世界日式建筑的形式立体呈现。
          建筑内部则依据战前仍然留存的资料、模型及设计图等考证进行复原。
          从柱体的各部分结构，到屋顶内部，均完成了精细的再现与复原。

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名称</p>
              <p class="text-base">福山城天守</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式城郭・天守</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建筑时期</p>
              <p class="text-base">江户时代初期</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                〒720-0061 广岛县福山市丸之内一丁目8番
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城年份</p>
              <p class="text-base">元和8年（1622年）</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城者</p>
              <p class="text-base">水野胜成</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
              <p class="text-base">复合式层塔型天守</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作软件</p>
              <p class="text-base">我的世界 Java Edition</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品类别</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式建筑复原・再现</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
              <p class="text-base">完成</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>



    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示照片
      </h2>

      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama4.jpg"
            alt="福山城天守"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama1.jpg"
            alt="福山城天守"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama2.jpg"
            alt="福山城天守"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/fukuyama3.jpg"
            alt="福山城天守"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 返回作品一览
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://youtube.com/shorts/_70qfq3ZFxc"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        查看更多作品 →
      </a>

    </div>


              <!-- Share -->
        <div class="mt-32 text-center">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          SHARE
        </p>

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        分享作品
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

        <!-- X -->
        <a
          href="#"
          id="x-share"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          X
        </a>

        <!-- Instagram -->
        <button
          type="button"
          id="instagram-share"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          Instagram
        </button>

        <!-- Copy -->
        <button
          type="button"
          id="copy-url"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          复制URL
        </button>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>



<script>

  const sharePhrases = [
    "找到这个了。",
    "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
    "看看这个。",
    "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
    "发现了这个。",
    "你知道这个吗？",
    "发现了个东西。",
    "原来还有这个。",
    "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
  ];

  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[
      Math.floor(
        Math.random() * sharePhrases.length
      )
    ];

  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/fukuyamacastle/";

  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 福山城天守阁 | WORKS`;

  const xShare =
    document.getElementById("x-share");

  const copyButton =
    document.getElementById("copy-url");

  const instagramButton =
    document.getElementById("instagram-share");


  if (xShare) {

    xShare.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );

  }


  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "已复制";

        setTimeout(() => {

          copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";

        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });


  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog =
      document.createElement("div");


    dialog.innerHTML = `

      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>


          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            在Instagram上分享
          </h3>


          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            复制此作品页面的URL后<br>
            将打开Instagram。
          </p>


          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            复制URL并打开Instagram
          </button>


          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            取消
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    `;


    document.body.appendChild(dialog);


    const overlay =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-share-overlay"
      );

    const openButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-open"
      );

    const cancelButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-cancel"
      );


    openButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      async () => {

        try {

          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
            pageUrl
          );

        } catch (error) {

          console.error(error);

        }


        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );


        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    cancelButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      () => {

        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    overlay?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (event) => {

        if (event.target === overlay) {

          overlay.remove();

        }

      }
    );

  });

</script>

<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
    heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
    center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
      scale(1.06)
      translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

}


section {

  position:
    relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
    "";

  position:
    absolute;

  left:
    0;

  top:
    0;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    100%;

  pointer-events:
    none;

  background-image:

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 8% 10%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.08),
      transparent 18%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 92% 82%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.06),
      transparent 22%
    );

}


aside {

  position:
    sticky;

  top:
    120px;

  height:
    max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
    .35s;

}



.gallery-frame {

  position:
    relative;

  padding:
    2px;

  border-radius:
    1.25rem;

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow:
    hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
    block;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    auto;

  border-radius:
    calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
    #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
      hidden;

  }

}



@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
      760px;

  }

  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
      1rem;

  }

  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
      calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}


</style>

</Layout>